 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "If you got a quote for new kitchen countertops and you were shocked by how expensive it was, watch this.",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 5.6
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "A lot of companies add a big markup on your countertops before they ever get to your kitchen.",
   "t0": 5.9,
   "t1": 10.2
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "So you end up paying way more for the exact same countertops.",
   "t0": 10.42,
   "t1": 13.66
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "text": "At GC Countertops, we do it differently.",
   "t0": 14.0,
   "t1": 15.94
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "text": "We source our countertops directly from the supplier, at contractor pricing.",
   "t0": 16.32,
   "t1": 20.16
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "text": "That's a price you just can't get if you go out and buy them yourself.",
   "t0": 20.4,
   "t1": 23.14
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "text": "And we pass that savings right on to you.",
   "t0": 23.52,
   "t1": 25.76
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "text": "That's why brand-new countertops start at just $30 per square foot for granite.",
   "t0": 25.94,
   "t1": 29.9
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "text": "Quartz starts at $55, and marble starts at $65.",
   "t0": 30.22,
   "t1": 33.34
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "text": "And every job comes with our 100% satisfaction guarantee.",
   "t0": 34.0,
   "t1": 37.44
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "text": "We don't leave your home until you're completely happy with the work.",
   "t0": 37.76,
   "t1": 40.48
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Click \"Get Quote\" to book your free in-home measurement and estimate, and see how much you can save.",
   "t0": 40.78,
   "t1": 44.88
  }
 ]
}